        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8461, Single Cylinder Rustic Wrought Steel Arched Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Wrought Steel Arched Deadbolt is reminiscent of days gone by. Its rustic look is due in part to the classic arch shape and the old world finishes really make this Wrought Steel Arched Deadbolt look like something that straight out of medieval times. This Wrought Steel #1 Style Deadbolt is made by Emtek and will fit most pre-drilled doors. A single cylinder deadbolt, the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Wrought Steel #1 Style Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Wrought steel collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Arched #1 Wrought Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Height: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Wrought-Steel-finish.jpg?v=1704354509\" width=\"351\" height=\"184\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Single Cylinder  Wrought Steel Arched Deadbolt",
                "description": "The Wrought Steel Arched Deadbolt is reminiscent of days gone by. Its rustic look is due in part to the classic arch shape and the old world finishes really make this Wrought Steel Arched Deadbolt look like something that straight out of medieval times. This Wrought Steel #1 Style Deadbolt is made by Emtek and will fit most pre-drilled doors. Choose from either a single cylinder deadbolt or a double cylinder deadbolt in flat black steel and satin steel finishes.",
